WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.708
Thirteen. I counted every one.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.261
Behind me. Wait for the bell.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.607
Hold still. That buckle's loose.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.052
Hear that? Someone's on the stairs.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.145
I filled that grave. Yesterday.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.437
[A creature snarls]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.789
Don't move.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.965
Cup your hands. The ember's still alive.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:42.321
[A hollow growl]

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:47.133
You brought my clapper back.

